### /portal/data-entry — BINARY CHOICE
THIS IS THE CRITICAL DECISION POINT.
Two cards. Clicking one NAVIGATES to a different route. No shared state.

Card 1: "Upload My Documents"
- onClick: router.push('/portal/upload')
- Pill: emerald "✦ Fastest — we do the work"
