Card 2: "Enter My Information"
- onClick: router.push('/portal/manual')
- Pill: cherry/7% "Guided form"
- Action: charcoal full-width button "Enter Manually →"

Cards have cherry top-border that animates in on hover (scaleX transform, origin left).
No checkboxes. No selection state. Click = navigate.

### /portal/upload
"← Choose a different option" → router.push('/portal/data-entry')

2×2 upload category cards:
- payroll: Payroll Reports 📊 | 2022·2023·2024·2025
- pandl: P&L / Expense Reports 📈 | 2022·2023·2024·2025
- taxid: FEIN & State Tax ID 🏛️ | Current documents
- gross_receipts: Gross Receipts 💰 | 2022·2023·2024·2025 | optional pill

Each card: dashed border → solid cherry on hover → solid emerald when has files
Green count badge top-right when files uploaded
Click → opens UploadModal for that category

UploadModal:
