Employee table columns:
Name | Type | State | Total Wages | Total Hrs Worked | % Time on R&D | R&D Hours (auto) | Qualified Amt (auto) | Project | ×

CALCULATION (real-time, client-side):
- R&D Hours = Total Hours Worked × (% R&D ÷ 100) — READ ONLY, green bg
- Qualified Amount = Total Wages × (% R&D ÷ 100) — READ ONLY, green bg
- Year total = sum(qualified_amounts) + sum(supply_amounts) — updates as user types

