## 6. API ROUTES

### POST /api/submissions
Admin only. Body: { contact_name, contact_email, company_name }
Returns: { submission_id }

### GET /api/submissions
Admin: all submissions. Client: own submission only.

### PATCH /api/submissions/[id]
Client: company info fields + status (invited→in_progress only)
Admin: all fields

### POST /api/employees
Body: { submission_id, tax_year, full_name, employee_type, state, total_wages, total_hours_worked, rd_percentage, project_name }
NOTE: rd_hours and qualified_amount are GENERATED COLUMNS — never send them, only read them.

### PATCH /api/employees/[id] | DELETE /api/employees/[id]

### POST /api/supplies
Body: { submission_id, tax_year, description, project_name, amount }

### PATCH /api/supplies/[id] | DELETE /api/supplies/[id]

### POST /api/documents/upload
Multipart: file, submission_id, category, tax_year
Storage path: submissions/{submission_id}/{category}/{tax_year}/{filename}
Returns: { document_id, storage_url, file_name }

### POST /api/exports/generate
Body: { submission_id }
1. Query qre_summary + credit_estimates views
2. Generate PDF (@react-pdf/renderer)
3. Generate Excel (xlsx — 3 sheets: Summary, Employee Data, Supplies)
4. Upload to storage: exports/{submission_id}/
5. Update submission: export_generated_at, pdf_url, excel_url
6. Send partner email (Resend — log only if not configured)
Returns: { pdf_url, excel_url }

