## 13. RULES — DO NOT VIOLATE

1. Read _design/wireframes.html before touching any component.
2. No new design decisions. Build what is shown.
3. Use CSS variables. Never hardcode hex colors.
4. Playfair Display for headings. Montserrat for everything else.
5. Generated columns (rd_hours, qualified_amount) are Postgres-computed. Never write to them.
6. Upload and Manual are separate routes. Never render both simultaneously.
7. Auto-save QRE data with 1500ms debounce. No manual save button for data entry.
8. Real-time calculation of R&D Hours and Qualified Amount is client-side only.
9. FM pattern on ALL cherry and charcoal backgrounds.
10. Use server.ts Supabase client in server components. Use client.ts in client components.